[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.000",
    "end": "00:00:03.962",
    "start_seconds": 0.0,
    "end_seconds": 3.962,
    "text": "I want to talk about alternative solutions to taking pills"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:03.962",
    "end": "00:00:07.632",
    "start_seconds": 3.962,
    "end_seconds": 7.632,
    "text": "for the rest of your life If you struggle with speaking anxiety"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:07.841",
    "end": "00:00:11.511",
    "start_seconds": 7.841,
    "end_seconds": 11.511,
    "text": "at all, you've probably encountered beta blockers such as prepare"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.678",
    "end": "00:00:15.098",
    "start_seconds": 11.678,
    "end_seconds": 15.098,
    "text": "all these pills you take that, reduce your heart rate,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:15.181",
    "end": "00:00:18.560",
    "start_seconds": 15.181,
    "end_seconds": 18.56,
    "text": "reduce your blood pressure, reduce the bodily symptoms you experience."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:18.685",
    "end": "00:00:23.648",
    "start_seconds": 18.685,
    "end_seconds": 23.648,
    "text": "A lot of people are looking to that as a solution to their speaking anxiety."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:23.773",
    "end": "00:00:26.860",
    "start_seconds": 23.773,
    "end_seconds": 26.86,
    "text": "I'm trusting the Montebello I was one of the fastest competitors"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.860",
    "end": "00:00:29.612",
    "start_seconds": 26.86,
    "end_seconds": 29.612,
    "text": "to reach the final of the World Championships of Public Speaking"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.612",
    "end": "00:00:33.700",
    "start_seconds": 29.612,
    "end_seconds": 33.7,
    "text": "and that journey completely changed my life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.867",
    "end": "00:00:35.201",
    "start_seconds": 33.867,
    "end_seconds": 35.201,
    "text": "It changed my confidence."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.201",
    "end": "00:00:37.245",
    "start_seconds": 35.201,
    "end_seconds": 37.245,
    "text": "It changed how I walked around in the world."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:37.245",
    "end": "00:00:42.500",
    "start_seconds": 37.245,
    "end_seconds": 42.5,
    "text": "And it led me to co-found a company, ultra speaking.com, with Michael Gendler,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:42.667",
    "end": "00:00:44.252",
    "start_seconds": 42.667,
    "end_seconds": 44.252,
    "text": "where we've devoted our lives"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.252",
    "end": "00:00:48.339",
    "start_seconds": 44.252,
    "end_seconds": 48.339,
    "text": "to figuring out how to solve public speaking anxiety once and for all."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:48.465",
    "end": "00:00:50.425",
    "start_seconds": 48.465,
    "end_seconds": 50.425,
    "text": "So let me start by saying that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:50.425",
    "end": "00:00:53.845",
    "start_seconds": 50.425,
    "end_seconds": 53.845,
    "text": "I have nothing particularly strong against prepared at all."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:53.845",
    "end": "00:00:58.058",
    "start_seconds": 53.845,
    "end_seconds": 58.058,
    "text": "I don't really like the idea of taking pills for the rest of my life in anything,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.308",
    "end": "00:01:02.729",
    "start_seconds": 58.308,
    "end_seconds": 62.729,
    "text": "but I know plenty of students who take for panel all have taken prepared a lot."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.854",
    "end": "00:01:05.607",
    "start_seconds": 62.854,
    "end_seconds": 65.607,
    "text": "But I know many, many more. Who."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.607",
    "end": "00:01:08.818",
    "start_seconds": 65.607,
    "end_seconds": 68.818,
    "text": "Have gotten off of these pills and no longer"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:08.818",
    "end": "00:01:10.862",
    "start_seconds": 68.818,
    "end_seconds": 70.862,
    "text": "imagine a world where they'd ever need them"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.862",
    "end": "00:01:14.824",
    "start_seconds": 70.862,
    "end_seconds": 74.824,
    "text": "because of the journey they've been on, tackling their speaking anxiety."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:15.158",
    "end": "00:01:19.204",
    "start_seconds": 75.158,
    "end_seconds": 79.20400000000001,
    "text": "The way I see a lot, I see it as a life jacket"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.287",
    "end": "00:01:20.538",
    "start_seconds": 79.287,
    "end_seconds": 80.538,
    "text": "you're thrown in the middle of the ocean"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:20.538",
    "end": "00:01:23.833",
    "start_seconds": 80.538,
    "end_seconds": 83.833,
    "text": "and you don't know how to swim, a life jacket will save your life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.875",
    "end": "00:01:27.128",
    "start_seconds": 83.875,
    "end_seconds": 87.128,
    "text": "But the reality is, if you are completely dependent"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:27.295",
    "end": "00:01:31.883",
    "start_seconds": 87.295,
    "end_seconds": 91.883,
    "text": "on this life jacket and you live in water world, then it's"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.883",
    "end": "00:01:37.680",
    "start_seconds": 91.883,
    "end_seconds": 97.68,
    "text": "probably a good idea to learn how to swim, In my mind, communication is ubiquitous."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:37.680",
    "end": "00:01:39.808",
    "start_seconds": 97.68,
    "end_seconds": 99.80799999999999,
    "text": "It's everywhere in your life,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:39.808",
    "end": "00:01:43.144",
    "start_seconds": 99.80799999999999,
    "end_seconds": 103.144,
    "text": "particularly the type of communication that you can't prepare for."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:43.436",
    "end": "00:01:47.482",
    "start_seconds": 103.436,
    "end_seconds": 107.482,
    "text": "So what can you do to reduce your anxiety?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.149",
    "end": "00:01:51.152",
    "start_seconds": 108.149,
    "end_seconds": 111.152,
    "text": "The three things I want to state number one is"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:51.611",
    "end": "00:01:55.406",
    "start_seconds": 111.61099999999999,
    "end_seconds": 115.406,
    "text": "you want to change the state in which your body is."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:55.573",
    "end": "00:01:58.952",
    "start_seconds": 115.57300000000001,
    "end_seconds": 118.952,
    "text": "When you find yourself in a situation where you know you're going to speak."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:59.077",
    "end": "00:02:03.665",
    "start_seconds": 119.077,
    "end_seconds": 123.665,
    "text": "if you have anxiety, you're experiencing a lot in your body."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.665",
    "end": "00:02:05.792",
    "start_seconds": 123.665,
    "end_seconds": 125.792,
    "text": "Your body is going to be on high alert."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:05.792",
    "end": "00:02:10.004",
    "start_seconds": 125.792,
    "end_seconds": 130.004,
    "text": "So before going to work, before a social situation, before a presentation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.296",
    "end": "00:02:14.425",
    "start_seconds": 130.296,
    "end_seconds": 134.425,
    "text": "go out for a long run, go out for a bike ride, a swim or a workout."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:14.676",
    "end": "00:02:17.679",
    "start_seconds": 134.676,
    "end_seconds": 137.679,
    "text": "Do anything that's going to release endorphins"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.929",
    "end": "00:02:20.849",
    "start_seconds": 137.929,
    "end_seconds": 140.849,
    "text": "and allow your body to have a lower baseline."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:20.849",
    "end": "00:02:24.936",
    "start_seconds": 140.849,
    "end_seconds": 144.936,
    "text": "Second piece of advice is take a breath before you speak."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.186",
    "end": "00:02:30.066",
    "start_seconds": 145.186,
    "end_seconds": 150.066,
    "text": "It sounds so simple, but if you just take one breath in and a long breath out."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:32.277",
    "end": "00:02:34.195",
    "start_seconds": 152.277,
    "end_seconds": 154.195,
    "text": "Which looks completely natural,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.195",
    "end": "00:02:37.115",
    "start_seconds": 154.195,
    "end_seconds": 157.115,
    "text": "you're going to lower your baseline, which is going to lower the peak"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.115",
    "end": "00:02:40.201",
    "start_seconds": 157.115,
    "end_seconds": 160.201,
    "text": "of anxiety, which is going to make you feel that much more comfortable."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:40.660",
    "end": "00:02:43.413",
    "start_seconds": 160.66,
    "end_seconds": 163.413,
    "text": "And last but not least, maybe the most important piece of advice"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:43.413",
    "end": "00:02:46.958",
    "start_seconds": 163.413,
    "end_seconds": 166.958,
    "text": "I can give you is join some kind of a club"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:47.375",
    "end": "00:02:51.045",
    "start_seconds": 167.375,
    "end_seconds": 171.04500000000002,
    "text": "that's going to create a safe environment for you to practice your skills."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.462",
    "end": "00:02:54.924",
    "start_seconds": 171.462,
    "end_seconds": 174.924,
    "text": "You can join a bowling club, a gardening club, a professional club."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:55.175",
    "end": "00:02:56.009",
    "start_seconds": 175.175,
    "end_seconds": 176.00900000000001,
    "text": "It doesn't matter."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:56.009",
    "end": "00:03:01.347",
    "start_seconds": 176.00900000000001,
    "end_seconds": 181.347,
    "text": "You can even join an ultra speaking club which is specialized in speaking anxiety."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01.347",
    "end": "00:03:06.853",
    "start_seconds": 181.347,
    "end_seconds": 186.853,
    "text": "But The only thing that matters is that you find yourself in a situation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:06.853",
    "end": "00:03:11.858",
    "start_seconds": 186.853,
    "end_seconds": 191.858,
    "text": "in a scenario where you're going to be with the same people week after week."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.192",
    "end": "00:03:13.401",
    "start_seconds": 192.192,
    "end_seconds": 193.401,
    "text": "Here's what's going to happen."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.401",
    "end": "00:03:15.945",
    "start_seconds": 193.401,
    "end_seconds": 195.945,
    "text": "You're going to get comfortable with these people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.945",
    "end": "00:03:19.532",
    "start_seconds": 195.945,
    "end_seconds": 199.532,
    "text": "You're they're all going to be rooting for you as a human being."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:19.699",
    "end": "00:03:20.909",
    "start_seconds": 199.699,
    "end_seconds": 200.909,
    "text": "And as a result, you're going to be able"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.909",
    "end": "00:03:24.662",
    "start_seconds": 200.909,
    "end_seconds": 204.662,
    "text": "to take more and more risks to show yourself more and more."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.829",
    "end": "00:03:27.582",
    "start_seconds": 204.829,
    "end_seconds": 207.582,
    "text": "And as you do so, in an environment that's very safe,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.582",
    "end": "00:03:30.251",
    "start_seconds": 207.582,
    "end_seconds": 210.251,
    "text": "where you're going to be rewarded for taking risks,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.251",
    "end": "00:03:33.421",
    "start_seconds": 210.251,
    "end_seconds": 213.421,
    "text": "your body is going to learn that it's actually safe in doing so,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.421",
    "end": "00:03:37.425",
    "start_seconds": 213.421,
    "end_seconds": 217.425,
    "text": "and you're going to have a playground where you can spend time"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.842",
    "end": "00:03:40.845",
    "start_seconds": 217.84199999999998,
    "end_seconds": 220.845,
    "text": "finding yourself and finding your own voice"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.179",
    "end": "00:03:44.182",
    "start_seconds": 221.179,
    "end_seconds": 224.18200000000002,
    "text": "what you're doing is you're building a stack of evidence"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.432",
    "end": "00:03:46.100",
    "start_seconds": 224.43200000000002,
    "end_seconds": 226.1,
    "text": "that builds up your confidence"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.100",
    "end": "00:03:49.103",
    "start_seconds": 226.1,
    "end_seconds": 229.103,
    "text": "and is going to allow you to then go into different environments"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:49.229",
    "end": "00:03:52.899",
    "start_seconds": 229.22899999999998,
    "end_seconds": 232.899,
    "text": "knowing what it feels like to be you, what it feels like"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.899",
    "end": "00:03:55.902",
    "start_seconds": 232.899,
    "end_seconds": 235.902,
    "text": "to be a confident version of you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.944",
    "end": "00:03:58.613",
    "start_seconds": 235.94400000000002,
    "end_seconds": 238.613,
    "text": "Look, there's no shame in taking medication for real problems."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.781",
    "end": "00:04:02.784",
    "start_seconds": 239.781,
    "end_seconds": 242.784,
    "text": "But for the vast majority of people,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:03.117",
    "end": "00:04:06.621",
    "start_seconds": 243.117,
    "end_seconds": 246.621,
    "text": "there's a world in which you can take the life jacket off and learn how to swim."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.996",
    "end": "00:04:08.915",
    "start_seconds": 246.996,
    "end_seconds": 248.915,
    "text": "I know this can be very scary."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.915",
    "end": "00:04:11.626",
    "start_seconds": 248.915,
    "end_seconds": 251.626,
    "text": "It's a big journey, and it's a very personal journey."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:11.626",
    "end": "00:04:14.837",
    "start_seconds": 251.626,
    "end_seconds": 254.837,
    "text": "It will be very unique to you, but it's going to be"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.505",
    "end": "00:04:19.550",
    "start_seconds": 255.505,
    "end_seconds": 259.55,
    "text": "very energizing and rewarding as you're on the journey."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.550",
    "end": "00:04:24.389",
    "start_seconds": 259.55,
    "end_seconds": 264.389,
    "text": "And I think that's what's magnificent about these personal growth ventures"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.389",
    "end": "00:04:29.102",
    "start_seconds": 264.389,
    "end_seconds": 269.102,
    "text": "that we get on as we take the first step, we get energy from that very thing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:29.560",
    "end": "00:04:32.689",
    "start_seconds": 269.56,
    "end_seconds": 272.689,
    "text": "So this is a truly worthwhile journey, and I wish you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.689",
    "end": "00:04:35.692",
    "start_seconds": 272.689,
    "end_seconds": 275.692,
    "text": "good luck."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.784",
    "end": "00:04:52.333",
    "start_seconds": 284.784,
    "end_seconds": 292.33299999999997,
    "text": "You like. Do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.427",
    "end": "00:08:00.563",
    "start_seconds": 302.427,
    "end_seconds": 480.563,
    "text": "You. Yeah."
  }
]
